+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Pre-mutation verification (provenance asserted)
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+/// Re-check every recorded member, cmp and escape against the live IR before
+/// any mutation. Analysis and apply run back-to-back so this always passes;
